{"math-numbers-expressions-n01":{"sha256":"1dfaee9175523a11e847bd2f7496ad1dcb8a6c77042300eadfcd0ac679df46c7","unit":{"schemaVersion":"1.1","unitId":"math-numbers-expressions-n01","revision":4,"status":"review","subject":"math-1a","chapter":{"chapterId":"math-ch01-numbers-expressions","chapterNumber":"1","chapterTitle":"数と式","unitCode":"1NUM","orderInChapter":1,"sourcePages":[2,3]},"title":"式の見方","subtitle":"数と文字を掛け算として読み、どの文字に注目するか考える。","source":{"type":"reference","label":"ユーザー提供「数と式」教科書モード対話段階導入版 v2 / N01","rightsNote":"教師作成WordのN01 Q1–Q10を原式に照合したレビュー用新規学習本文。啓林館「深進数学Ⅰ」教科書ガイドへの原稿側言及は元教科書への独立アクセスや再配布許諾を意味しない。解答別冊なし・独立解法監査。"},"objectives":["数と文字の積を一つずつ読み取る","注目する文字を変えて式の見方を比べる","同じ文字の部分をまとめた結果から式を読む"],"sections":[{"id":"lesson","number":"01","title":"本文","description":"問い→意味→用語→別の式への応用をつなげる。","role":"concept","figures":[],"readingFlow":[{"id":"heading-factors","type":"heading","text":"式を掛け算に戻す"},{"id":"marker-factor-example","type":"marker","kind":"example","text":"例題"},{"id":"paragraph-intro","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"次の三つの式を比べよう。"},{"type":"math","latex":"-2x,\\quad x^2,\\quad -x^2y^2"},{"type":"text","text":"。どれも数と文字の掛け算で読める。例えば "},{"type":"math","latex":"x^2=x\\times x"},{"type":"text","text":" である。マイナスがあるときは、符号も数の部分に含めて考える。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-01-before","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数と次数を別々に読むため、先に一つの式を「数×文字×文字…」へ戻す。負号が付いていても、文字を数える操作と符号を扱う操作を混ぜない。"}]},{"id":"formula-n01-01","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"-x^2y^2="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-01"},{"type":"math","latex":"\\times x\\times x\\times y\\times y"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-01-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"先頭の数は係数を読むため、後ろに並ぶ文字は次数を数えるために使える。同じ分解から二種類の情報を取り出す。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-concept-monomial","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"このように数と文字の積で表した式を"},{"type":"term","text":"単項式"},{"type":"text","text":"という。ここでは文字の指数を0以上の整数として扱う。数の部分を"},{"type":"term","text":"係数"},{"type":"text","text":"、掛け合わせた文字の総数を"},{"type":"term","text":"次数"},{"type":"text","text":"という。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-coefficient-compare","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"三つの式をもう一度見よう。次の各式について（係数，次数）の組を完成させよう。文字の前に数が書かれていなくても、数の部分はある。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-negative-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数と次数を同時に決める前に、数と文字を分ける。−2xの数の部分を、符号ごと残そう。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-negative-formula","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"-2x=("},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-negative"},{"type":"math","latex":")x"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-negative-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数は、文字xに何を掛けているかを表す。この数と、次に数える文字の個数は別の情報である。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-linear-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"この項ではxが一つ掛かっている。右上の省略された指数を補おう。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-linear-formula","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"\\text{xを掛けた個数}="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-linear"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-linear-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"指数1は普通省略する。したがって−2xの次数は1になる。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"formula-n01-02a","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"-2x\\;\\longrightarrow\\; (\\text{係数,次数})="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-02a"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-one-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"x²の前には数が書かれていない。値を変えずに掛けられる数を補おう。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-one-formula","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"x^2="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-one"},{"type":"math","latex":"\\cdot x^2"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-one-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"数が書かれていないときも係数が無いのではなく、1を省略している。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"formula-n01-02b","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"x^2\\;\\longrightarrow\\; (\\text{係数,次数})="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-02b"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-total-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"x²y²は、xが2個、yが2個の積である。注目する文字をまだ限定していないので、両方を数える。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-total-formula","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"\\text{文字の総数}=2+2="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-total"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-total-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数の−1は文字の個数に含めない。この総数と係数を、次の組の回答へ戻す。"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"formula-n01-02c","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"-x^2y^2\\;\\longrightarrow\\; (\\text{係数,次数})="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-02c"}],"derivationId":"coefficients"},{"id":"heading-variable","type":"heading","text":"どの文字を見るか"},{"id":"marker-variable-example","type":"marker","kind":"example","text":"例題"},{"id":"paragraph-variable-intro","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"同じ式 "},{"type":"math","latex":"5x^3y"},{"type":"text","text":" でも、注目する文字によって見方が変わる。"},{"type":"math","latex":"x"},{"type":"text","text":" に注目するとき、"},{"type":"math","latex":"y"},{"type":"text","text":" は変わらない数とみなす。"},{"type":"text","text":"そこで、"},{"type":"math","latex":"x^3"},{"type":"text","text":" の前に掛かるものを一つにまとめよう。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-03-before","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"この問題ではxだけが変化すると考える。yを消すのではなく、数5と一緒に係数側へ移して、x³に何が掛かるかを見える形にする。"}]},{"id":"formula-n01-03","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"5x^3y="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-03"},{"type":"math","latex":"\\,x^3"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-03-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"掛け算の順を入れ替えただけなので式の値は変わらない。注目する文字をyへ変えるときも、同じ方法でyの外側に残るものを集める。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-04-before-0-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"yを一つ残し、他の因子を前へまとめる。yの指数が書かれていないときは1である。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-04-before-0-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"5x^3y=(5x^3)y^1"}]},{"id":"paragraph-variable-switch","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"いまの結果から、"},{"type":"math","latex":"x"},{"type":"text","text":" に注目した係数が読める。同じ式を今度は "},{"type":"math","latex":"y"},{"type":"text","text":" について見ると、（係数，次数）は "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-04"},{"type":"text","text":" となる。"}]},{"id":"marker-variable-check","type":"marker","kind":"check","text":"確認"},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-05-before","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数は式ごとに固定された一つの数とは限らない。注目しない文字をいったん数と見て、注目する文字に何が掛かるかを二通りに分けて読む。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-05","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"同じ考え方を "},{"type":"math","latex":"axy"},{"type":"text","text":" に使おう。"},{"type":"math","latex":"x"},{"type":"text","text":" に注目した係数と、"},{"type":"math","latex":"y"},{"type":"text","text":" に注目した係数をこの順に書くと "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-05"},{"type":"text","text":" となる。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-05-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"xを残す見方とyを残す見方で、外へまとめるものが違う。元の式は同じでも、何について整理するかで係数が変わる。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-05-math-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"axy=(ay)x=(ax)y"}]},{"id":"paragraph-variable-bridge","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"注目する文字以外を、係数側にひとまとめにする。式そのものを別の式に変えたわけではない。"}]},{"id":"heading-like-terms","type":"heading","text":"同じ種類の項を集める"},{"id":"marker-like-example","type":"marker","kind":"example","text":"例題"},{"id":"paragraph-like-intro","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"次の式を簡単にしよう。"}]},{"id":"formula-like-original","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"3x^2-5x+6-5x^2+2x-3"}]},{"id":"paragraph-term-concept","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"引き算は負の数を足すこととして読み取れる。符号も含めた一つ一つのまとまりを"},{"type":"term","text":"項"},{"type":"text","text":"といい、単項式の和で表した式を"},{"type":"term","text":"多項式"},{"type":"text","text":"という。文字の部分が同じ項を"},{"type":"term","text":"同類項"},{"type":"text","text":"という。同類項をまとめるときは、符号もその項と一緒に扱う。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-06a","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"まず "},{"type":"math","latex":"x^2"},{"type":"text","text":" の項を取り出すと "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-06a"},{"type":"text","text":" である。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-06b","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"残る "},{"type":"math","latex":"x"},{"type":"text","text":" の項と定数の項を分けると "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-06b"},{"type":"text","text":" となる。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-07-intro","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"三つに分けた項について、同じ文字の係数を計算しよう。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-r3-q07-x2coef-before-0-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"同じx²を一つ外へ出す。3と−5が、そのまま括弧内へ残る。"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-r3-q07-x2coef-before-0-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"3x^2-5x^2=(3+(-5))x^2=(3-5)x^2"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"formula-r3-q07-x2coef","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"=(3-5)x^2+(-5+2)x+(6-3)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad("},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-r3-q07-x2coef"},{"type":"math","latex":")x^2+(-5+2)x+(6-3)"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-r3-q07-xcoef-before-0-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"一次項も同じ操作を行う。xを掛ける前の数だけを足す。"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-r3-q07-xcoef-before-0-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"-5x+2x=(-5+2)x"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"formula-r3-q07-xcoef","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"=(-2)x^2+(-5+2)x+(6-3)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad(-2)x^2+("},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-r3-q07-xcoef"},{"type":"math","latex":")x+(6-3)"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"formula-r3-q07-const","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"=(-2)x^2+(-3)x+(6-3)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad(-2)x^2+(-3)x+("},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-r3-q07-const"},{"type":"math","latex":")"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-07-before","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"同類項を集めた後は、文字の部分を共通因数として残す。このため、足し引きするのは文字の指数ではなく、各項に掛かる係数である。"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"formula-n01-07","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"=(3-5)x^2+(-5+2)x+(6-3)="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-07"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-07-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"二次、一次、定数の計算を独立に終えてから、次数の高い順へ並べ直した。この順序なら符号を持つ項を途中で落としにくい。"}],"derivationId":"n01-q07-evaluate"},{"id":"paragraph-n01-08","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"多項式の"},{"type":"term","text":"次数"},{"type":"text","text":"は、同類項をまとめた後に残る項の次数の最大値。注目する文字を含まない項を"},{"type":"term","text":"定数項"},{"type":"text","text":"という。今整理した式の（次数，定数項）は "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-08"},{"type":"text","text":" となる。"}]},{"id":"marker-degree-check","type":"marker","kind":"check","text":"確認"},{"id":"paragraph-cancellation-intro","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"整理する前に次数を決めてよいのだろうか。次の式を同じ手順で整理してみよう。"}]},{"id":"formula-cancellation-original","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"x^3-2x^2+x-x^3+3x-1"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09a-before-0-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"省略されている係数を補い、符号ごと読み取る。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09a-before-0-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"x^3=1\\cdot x^3"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09a-before-0-equation-1","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":" -x^3=(-1)x^3"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09a-before-1-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"三次の二項、一次の二項は、それぞれ共通する文字の部分を残す。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09a-before-1-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"x^3-x^3=(1-1)x^3"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09a-before-1-equation-1","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":" x+3x=(1+3)x"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-09a","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"同類項で組み直すと "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-09a"},{"type":"text","text":" となる。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-audit-cancel-cube-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"前の例題と同じように、まず三次項の係数だけを計算する。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-audit-cancel-cube-formula","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"(1-1)x^3="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-bridge-audit-cancel-cube"},{"type":"math","latex":"x^3"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-bridge-audit-cancel-cube-after-0-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数0の項は値が0なので、式から取り除ける。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-bridge-audit-cancel-cube-after-0-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"0x^3=0"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-audit-cancel-linear-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"次に一次項の係数を計算する。二次項−2x²と定数−1はそのまま残す。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-audit-cancel-linear-formula","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"(1+3)x="},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-bridge-audit-cancel-linear"},{"type":"math","latex":"x"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09b-assemble-0-lead","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"計算した二つの係数を、元の位置へ戻す。ここから値0の項を消して整理する。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-worked-n01-09b-assemble-0-equation-0","type":"formula","parts":[{"type":"math","latex":"(1-1)x^3-2x^2+(1+3)x-1=0x^3-2x^2+4x-1"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-09b","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"係数を計算して整理すると "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-09b"},{"type":"text","text":" である。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-10a-before","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"次数を調べるのは整理した後である。元の式に高い次数の項が見えていても、その係数の和が0ならその項は残らない。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-10a","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"整理した結果、この多項式は "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-10a"},{"type":"text","text":" である。"}]},{"id":"n01-bridge-explain-n01-10a-after","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"消えた項を最高次数として数えず、係数が0でない項のうち最大の指数を読む。この結果が次の理由の判断につながる。"}]},{"id":"paragraph-n01-10b","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"そのように判断できる理由は "},{"type":"choice","itemId":"n01-10b"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"id":"marker-n01-summary","type":"marker","kind":"summary","text":"ここまでの要点"},{"id":"paragraph-summary","type":"paragraph","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"式を読むときは、"},{"type":"term","text":"注目する文字"},{"type":"text","text":"を決め、"},{"type":"term","text":"同類項"},{"type":"text","text":"をまとめてから、残った項の"},{"type":"term","text":"次数"},{"type":"text","text":"を判断する。この考え方を次の長い式の整理と足し引きにも使う。"}]}],"items":[{"id":"n01-01","label":"N01-01","prompt":"負号を含めた数の部分を選ぼう。","answer":"-1","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["-1","1","-2"],"purpose":"concept-formation","scaffoldLevel":"strong","hints":["式全体の前にあるマイナスは、文字ではなく数の部分に入る。"]},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-negative","label":"N01-BRIDGE-DETAIL-COEFFICIENT-NEGATIVE","prompt":"係数と次数を同時に決める前に、数と文字を分ける。−2xの数の部分を、符号ごと残そう。","answer":"-2","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["-2","2","-1","1"],"purpose":"causal-reasoning","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["負号も係数の一部として読む。"]},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-linear","label":"N01-BRIDGE-DETAIL-DEGREE-LINEAR","prompt":"この項ではxが一つ掛かっている。右上の省略された指数を補おう。","answer":"1","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["1","0","2","-1"],"purpose":"causal-reasoning","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["xを一つ書いた形と、xを二つ掛けた形を区別する。"]},{"id":"n01-02a","label":"N01-02A","prompt":"−2xの係数と次数を選ぼう。","answer":"(-2,1)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(-2,1)","(2,1)","(-2,2)"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"strong","hints":["符号は係数に、掛け合わせた文字の個数は次数に入る。"]},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-coefficient-one","label":"N01-BRIDGE-DETAIL-COEFFICIENT-ONE","prompt":"x²の前には数が書かれていない。値を変えずに掛けられる数を補おう。","answer":"1","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["1","0","2","-1"],"purpose":"causal-reasoning","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["その数を掛けてもx²の値が変わらないことを確かめる。"]},{"id":"n01-02b","label":"N01-02B","prompt":"x²の係数と次数を選ぼう。","answer":"(1,2)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(1,2)","(2,1)","(0,2)"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"strong","hints":["見えない係数も掛け算に戻して考える。"]},{"id":"n01-bridge-detail-degree-total","label":"N01-BRIDGE-DETAIL-DEGREE-TOTAL","prompt":"x²y²は、xが2個、yが2個の積である。注目する文字をまだ限定していないので、両方を数える。","answer":"4","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["4","2","3","5"],"purpose":"causal-reasoning","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["指数の積ではなく、掛かっている文字の個数の合計を求める。"]},{"id":"n01-02c","label":"N01-02C","prompt":"−x²y²の係数と次数を選ぼう。","answer":"(-1,4)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(-1,4)","(1,4)","(-1,2)"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["xとyを掛けている総数を数える。"]},{"id":"n01-03","label":"N01-03","prompt":"x³に掛かるものをまとめよう。","answer":"5y","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["5y","5","5x"],"purpose":"concept-formation","scaffoldLevel":"strong","hints":["xに注目するとき、yは係数に含められる。"]},{"id":"n01-04","label":"N01-04","prompt":"yについて見た係数と次数を選ぼう。","answer":"(5x^3,1)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(5x^3,1)","(5y,3)","(5x^3,3)"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["今度はyだけを変える文字として数える。"]},{"id":"n01-05","label":"N01-05","prompt":"xとyに注目した係数をこの順に選ぼう。","answer":"(ay,ax)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(ay,ax)","(ax,ay)","(a,a)"],"purpose":"transfer","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["注目しない文字を係数に含める。順序にも注意。"]},{"id":"n01-06a","label":"N01-06A","prompt":"x²を含む二つの項を符号ごと選ぼう。","answer":"3x^2-5x^2","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["3x^2-5x^2","3x^2+5x^2","3x^2-5x"],"purpose":"concept-formation","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["文字の部分が同じ項だけを抜き出す。"]},{"id":"n01-06b","label":"N01-06B","prompt":"残りのxの項と定数項の二組を選ぼう。","answer":"(-5x+2x)\\quad (6-3)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(-5x+2x)\\quad (6-3)","(5x+2x)\\quad (6-3)","(-5x-2x)\\quad (6+3)"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["符号も含めて元の式から項を拾う。"]},{"id":"n01-r3-q07-x2coef","label":"N01-R3-Q07-X2COEF","prompt":"x²の係数 3−5 を計算しよう。","answer":"-2","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["-2","2","-8"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["3から5を引く。符号まで答えに含めよう。"]},{"id":"n01-r3-q07-xcoef","label":"N01-R3-Q07-XCOEF","prompt":"xの係数 −5+2 を計算しよう。","answer":"-3","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["-3","3","-7"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["負の5と正の2を加える。"]},{"id":"n01-r3-q07-const","label":"N01-R3-Q07-CONST","prompt":"定数項 6−3 を計算しよう。","answer":"3","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["3","-3","9"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["文字を含まない二つの数を計算する。"]},{"id":"n01-07","label":"N01-07","prompt":"分類した三組の係数をそれぞれ計算しよう。","answer":"-2x^2-3x+3","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["-2x^2-3x+3","-2x^2+3x+3","-2x^2-3x-3","-2x-3x^2+3"],"purpose":"transfer","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["各組の数だけを計算し、文字の部分は残す。"]},{"id":"n01-08","label":"N01-08","prompt":"整理後の次数と定数項の組を選ぼう。","answer":"(2,3)","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(2,3)","(3,2)","(2,-3)"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"medium","hints":["すでに計算した式の中で、最大次数と定数項を探す。"]},{"id":"n01-09a","label":"N01-09A","prompt":"同類項をまとめて並べる式を選ぼう。","answer":"(1-1)x^3-2x^2+(1+3)x-1","acceptedAnswers":[],"answerType":"formula","choices":["(1-1)x^3-2x^2+(1+3)x-1","(1+1)x^3-2x^2+(1+3)x-1","(1-1)x^3+2x^2+(1+3)x-1","(1-1)x^3-2x^2+(1-3)x-1"],"purpose":"representation-link","scaffoldLevel":"